Hi Dr. Jose,

The parameter data.BED should be an object of data.frame but not a file name. You could try:

macs.peaks.bed <- read.delim("macs_peaks.BED", header=FALSE)
BED2RangedData(macs.peaks.bed)

Yours sincerely,

Jianhong Ou

jianhong.ou at umassmed.edu


