 .>              'c' is a primitive function;  methods can be defined, but
 .>             the generic function is implicit, and cannot be changed.
 .>
 .>         2. Trying to dispatch on "missing" or "ANY":
 .>
 .>            > setMethod("c", "missing", function(x, ..., recursive=FALSE)
 .>     "YES!")
